# De BER Ta
spatial-computing:DeBERTa rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "De BER Ta"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Decoding-enhanced BERT with Disentangled Attention: an improved BERT architecture that uses disentangled attention (separating content and position) and an enhanced mask decoder for better performance."@en ;
