# Tokenisation
artificial-intelligence:Tokenisation rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Tokenisation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The process of breaking text into discrete units (tokens) that can be processed by neural networks, ranging from characters to subwords to whole words."@en ;
