# Subword Tokenisation
spatial-computing:SubwordTokenisation rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Subword Tokenisation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A tokenisation approach that breaks words into smaller meaningful units, balancing vocabulary size with the ability to represent rare words and novel compositions."@en ;
