    rdfs:label "AIDomain"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The abbreviated reference for the Artificial Intelligence Domain, serving as a top-level ontological classification for all AI-related concepts including methods, systems, applications, and governance frameworks within the knowledge graph."@en ;
