    rdfs:comment "A Sovereign Mesh agentic runtime container that orchestrates DID Nostr Identity agents across a decentralised Peer-to-Peer Network, enabling autonomous agents to operate with verifiable credentials, pluggable adapters, and content-addressed state through a unified URI Canonicaliser and Linked Data Encoder."@en ;
