# Enterprise Token Standards
blockchain:EnterpriseTokenStandards rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Enterprise Token Standards"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Specialised blockchain protocols embedding regulatory compliance, transfer restrictions, and identity verification directly in Smart Contract, enabling compliant tokenisation of securities, real estate, and private equity whilst maintaining Selective Disclosure and Programmable Corporate Action—exemplified by ERC-1400 and ERC-3643."@en ;
