# Hyperledger Indy
blockchain:HyperledgerIndy rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Hyperledger Indy"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Specialised distributed ledger technology designed exclusively for decentralised identity management, implementing Self-Sovereign Identity through Decentralized Identifier, Verifiable Credential, and Zero-Knowledge Proof—enabling privacy-preserving credential verification deployed at scale by Sovrin Network, British Columbia's OrgBook, and healthcare providers."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Hyperledger Indy"@en ;
    vcw:canonicalUri "urn:visionclaw:concept:blockchain:hyperledger-indy" ;
