# Cold Chain Monitoring
blockchain:ColdChainMonitoring rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Cold Chain Monitoring"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Technology-enabled tracking system maintaining and verifying temperature-controlled conditions for perishable goods throughout storage, transportation, and distribution networks. Monitoring Systems utilise IoT Sensors, Real-Time Tracking, and Blockchain Records to ensure product quality and Compliance Evidence."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cold Chain Monitoring"@en ;
