# Carbon Credit Tracking
blockchain:CarbonCreditTracking rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Carbon Credit Tracking"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Blockchain-based system recording, verifying, and trading carbon emission reduction credits to incentivise sustainability and enable Carbon Offsetting markets. This Tracking System integrates Verified Emissions Data, Audit Trails, and Automated Compliance verification."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Carbon Credit Tracking"@en ;
