# Tokenomics Governance
blockchain:TokenomicsGovernance rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Tokenomics Governance"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Tokenomics governance combines TokenEconomicDesign principles with DAO decision-making mechanisms, defining how GovernanceToken holders participate in protocol development, parameter adjustment, and resource allocation through voting on ProposalFramework. Sophisticated frameworks balance voting power distribution across stakeholders (developers, users, long-term holders), implement QuadraticVoting or ConvictionVoting to counter plutocracy, and use TokenWeighting to align incentives across protocol components. Well-designed tokenomics governance enables sustainable protocol evolution, community alignment, and wealth redistribution whilst preventing governance attacks and capture through SlashingMechanism conditions, vote escrowing, and TimeLocks mechanisms."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tokenomics Governance"@en ;
    vcw:canonicalUri "urn:visionclaw:concept:blockchain:tokenomics-governance" ;
    owl:sameAs <urn:visionclaw:concept:blockchain:tokenomics-governance> ;
    vcw:contentHash "sha256-12-15f8c51d0616" ;
