# Delegate Democracy
blockchain:DelegateDemocracy rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Delegate Democracy"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A governance model enabling Token Holders to delegate voting authority to representatives who actively participate in DAO decision-making on their behalf, balancing direct participation with practical governance effectiveness. Delegate democracy addresses voter participation challenges whilst maintaining Token-Weighted Influence and creating accountable, professionalised governance participation through Delegation Mechanics."@en ;
