    rdfs:label "AML KYC Compliance"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Regulatory framework combining Anti-Money Laundering (AML) and Know Your Customer (KYC) protocols to verify customer identity, detect suspicious financial activity, and prevent illicit transactions. These Compliance Measures are enforced through Financial Regulations and enabled by Digital Identity verification systems."@en ;
