    rdfs:label "Asia Pacific Regulation"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Regional regulatory framework governing blockchain, cryptocurrency, and digital asset operations across Asia-Pacific jurisdictions including Singapore, Hong Kong, Japan, and Australia. This Regulatory Framework defines Compliance Obligations, Licensing Requirements, and Consumer Protection standards."@en ;
