# Cross Border Compliance
blockchain:CrossBorderCompliance rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Cross Border Compliance"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Multi-jurisdictional framework aligning organisational operations with regulatory requirements across different countries, addressing tax obligations, employment law, and trade regulations. These Compliance Programs navigate Jurisdictional Differences, Reporting Requirements, and Regulatory Harmonisation."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cross Border Compliance"@en ;
