# Carbon Neutral Blockchain
blockchain:CarbonNeutralBlockchain rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Carbon Neutral Blockchain"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Blockchain implementation achieving net-zero carbon emissions through renewable energy usage, carbon offsetting, or proof-of-stake consensus mechanisms that minimise computational requirements. These systems align Distributed Ledger Technology with Environmental Sustainability and Climate Commitments."@en ;
