    rdfs:comment "Educational Technology in the metaverse context encompasses the tools, platforms, and methodologies for delivering learning experiences in immersive virtual environments. This includes virtual classrooms, simulation-based training, immersive learning experiences, and collaborative educational spaces that leverage spatial computing for enhanced knowledge transfer."@en ;
