    rdfs:label "VRM Format"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An open file format standard for 3D humanoid avatars built on glTF, designed for cross-platform interoperability in VR, AR, and metaverse applications, incorporating standardized rigging, facial expressions, gaze controls, and licensing metadata to enable seamless avatar use across different virtual environments."@en ;
