# ETSI_Domain_Human_Interface___UX
spatial-computing:ETSI_Domain_Human_Interface___UX rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "ETSI_Domain_Human_Interface___UX"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An ETSI subdomain focusing on user experience design, usability engineering, and interaction paradigms optimising satisfaction, efficiency, and accessibility in VirtualEnvironment. This specialisation covers DesignPrinciples, UsabilityTesting, AccessibilityCompliance, and InclusiveUXDesign ensuring equitable digital participation."@en ;
