# ETSI_Domain_Human_Interface___Governance
artificial-intelligence:ETSI_Domain_Human_Interface___Governance rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "ETSI_Domain_Human_Interface___Governance"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "An ETSI subdomain addressing governance mechanisms, policy frameworks, and institutional structures governing human-centric systems in VirtualEnvironment. This specialised domain combines DecentralisedGovernance, RoleBasedAccess, ConsentManagement, and PolicyEnforcement to establish accountable, transparent participation structures."@en ;
