# Central Bank Digital Currency (CBDC)
infrastructure:CBDC rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Central Bank Digital Currency (CBDC)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Sovereign digital currency issued and backed by a central bank for use in retail or wholesale payment systems, functioning as legal tender in digital form."@en ;
