# Public Blockchain
infrastructure:PublicBlockchain rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Public Blockchain"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Permissionless, decentralised blockchain networks enabling unrestricted transaction participation and transparent validation without centralised authority, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Cardano, providing Censorship Resistance, Immutability, and User Sovereignty whilst sacrificing scalability and energy efficiency compared to private alternatives."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Public Blockchain"@en ;
