# Distributor
spatial-computing:Distributor rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Distributor"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A natural or legal person in the supply chain, other than the provider or the importer, that makes an AI system available on the Union market."@en ;
