    rdfs:label "HRI_SAFETY_TERMS_SUMMARY"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A comprehensive reference document synthesising critical terminology, standards, and best practices for HumanRobotInteraction safety across RoboticSystems and physical environments. This summary aggregates RobotSafety, OperatorProtection, FailureMode, and RiskMitigation concepts enabling safe autonomous and collaborative robotic operations."@en ;
