# Authentication Standards
infrastructure:AuthenticationStandards rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf infrastructure:SecurityStandards ;
    rdfs:label "Authentication Standards"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Authentication Standards encompass protocols and specifications for verifying user identity in digital systems, particularly FIDO2 and WebAuthn standards that enable passwordless, phishing-resistant authentication using public key cryptography and hardware authenticators for secure access to metaverse platforms and blockchain applications."@en ;
