# Edge Computing Architecture
spatial-computing:EdgeComputingArchitecture rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf spatial-computing:DistributedSystemArchitecture ;
    rdfs:label "Edge Computing Architecture"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A distributed computing paradigm that positions computational resources closer to end-user devices such as VR headsets and AR glasses, reducing latency, improving responsiveness, and enabling scalable metaverse experiences by offloading processing from centralised cloud servers."@en ;
