# Governance Framework
artificial-intelligence:GovernanceFramework rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf artificial-intelligence:OrganisationalFramework ;
    rdfs:label "Governance Framework"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A governance framework is a structured system of policies, processes, procedures, and controls that organisations use to align their technology resources and operations with business objectives. It provides the foundation for strategic decision-making, risk management, resource optimisation, performance measurement, and compliance, ensuring that technology investments deliver value while maintaining accountability and transparency."@en ;
