    owl:onProperty infrastructure:enables ;
    owl:someValuesFrom infrastructure:TrustworthinessAssurance
] .

infrastructure:TrustFramework vcw:bridgesTo infrastructure:TrustInfrastructure .

infrastructure:TrustFramework vcw:bridgesTo infrastructure:PolicyEnforcement .

