    rdfs:label "Communication Protocol"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Communication protocol defines message formats, transmission rules, addressing schemes, and error-handling procedures that enable robots and computational systems to reliably exchange information over wired or wireless channels. Protocols form the foundational layer enabling Inter-Robot Communication, centralised control architectures, sensor data fusion, and multi-robot task coordination."@en ;
