    rdfs:comment "**Collision Avoidance** - An active safety mechanism using Sensors (lidar, ultrasonic, vision) and path planning algorithms to detect obstacles and dynamically modify Robot Trajectories to prevent unintended contact with people, equipment, or structures."@en ;
