    rdfs:label "Backlash"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "**Backlash** - The non-linear loss of motion in a mechanical transmission system caused by gaps, tolerances, or wear between gears, joints, or actuators, compromising Precision, Repeatability, and Accuracy in robotic manipulation."@en ;
